starting with X11R5 you add colors like this:
- set environment variable XCMSDB to point to a color file
- here is a sample file:
XCMS_COLORDB_START 0.1
SeaBlue1	#51F38C5BC395
SeaBlue2	#1C225D898E14
Taupe1 	        #B78D90BB7925 
Taupe2	        #CA7EB93AA570
White           RGBi:1.0/1.0/1.0
XCMS_COLORDB_END

- you don't need to recompile your color database

- avoid #RRGGBB if possible since it truncates color values instead
  of rounding them (#F8F8F8 is brighter than #FFF)



