library. It appears that the name of the shared library is also stored
in the library file itself. 

As a consequence, although the renamed shared library file (e.g. 
libRenamedReal.so) is found by ld when creating the "dummy" libReal.so,
the dependencies of the dummy library (revealed through odump -Dl)
