> [snip]

Hi Tommy,

why all that work?!
Just being root at init level 3, do the following:
1. backup /vmunix (as you do)
2. cd /sys/conf
3. doconfig -c CLONE95
4. don't change anything (as you do)
5. unsuccesful build ? RETRY (not more than a couple of times ;)
6. cp /sys/CLONE95/vmunix /vmunix
7. reboot

HTH, julio

